# Interview preparation. Local only: these are personal notes about how to
# present the work, not documentation of the stack, and a reviewer cloning
# this repository has no reason to read them. Everything the repo needs to
# stand on its own (README, EXERCISE, TWO_REPOS, SECRETS, MONITORING,
# THREAT_MODEL, K8S_FROM_SCRATCH, adr/) stays tracked.
#
# Already committed one of these? `git rm --cached <path>` once; ignoring
# a tracked file does nothing on its own.
docs/ELEVATOR_PITCH.md
docs/INTERVIEW_NOTES.md
docs/DEMO_SCRIPT.md
interview_prep-*.md
walkthrough.sh
.DS_Store
